WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.281 --> 00:00:03.990
(swishing and squeaking)

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.304
- [Girl's Voice] My name is Aly Clipper,

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.961
and I have Deutan Color Blindness.

00:00:07.961 --> 00:00:11.461
(gentle percussion music)

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:13.712
When I first discovered

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.376
that I was color blind,

00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:16.830
I was in Kindergarten

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.098
and my teacher noticed that

00:00:18.098 --> 00:00:21.530
I was coloring the sky purple
and the grass was brown.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.732
They didn't think that
girls could be color blind.

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.686
The most true color I can see is yellow.

00:00:26.686 --> 00:00:30.455
All the rest, I have a
really hard time deciphering.

00:00:30.455 --> 00:00:32.790
Definitely, it affects my daily life.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.290
(upbeat percussion music)

00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:45.239
I am extremely excited to
see color for the first time

00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:47.791
and if it actually works.

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:50.112
We are going to the park.

00:00:50.112 --> 00:00:52.055
I'm feeling super nervous right now.

00:00:52.055 --> 00:00:54.142
There's that chance that they don't work.

00:00:54.142 --> 00:00:56.758
But I'm very excited too.

00:00:56.758 --> 00:00:58.583
So, we are...

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.178
finally opening up,

00:01:00.178 --> 00:01:02.662
for the first time, my Enchroma glasses.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.447
I'm just super excited.

00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:07.864
(gentle inspiring music)

00:01:13.018 --> 00:01:15.527
Everything's so much more colorful.

00:01:15.527 --> 00:01:18.205
Like, these, like these flowers over here,

00:01:18.205 --> 00:01:21.159
they're normally white when I
don't have these glasses on,

00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:24.195
and now, they're like, like a yellow.

00:01:24.195 --> 00:01:27.228
The sky is really blue. (giggling)

00:01:27.228 --> 00:01:28.783
That's crazy.

00:01:28.783 --> 00:01:30.648
And when I have the glasses on,

00:01:30.648 --> 00:01:32.767
it's like, just super red.

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:34.623
When I don't have the glasses on,

00:01:34.623 --> 00:01:39.455
like the leaves and the
flowers look really similar.

00:01:39.455 --> 00:01:42.796
It's a very noticeable difference.

00:01:42.796 --> 00:01:45.568
Everything is just so vivid.

00:01:45.568 --> 00:01:50.183
I never thought that colors
could be so beautiful.

00:01:50.183 --> 00:01:53.350
(upbeat, happy music)

00:01:56.927 --> 00:01:59.385
(swishing and squeaking)

